# Where the Go API lives. Set this on the Vercel project (Settings → Environment Variables) and
# in a local .env.local while developing.
#
# The site is entirely static apart from this: there are no Next.js API routes, so nothing runs on
# Vercel's servers at request time and the whole thing is served from the CDN.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=https://api.yourapp.duckdns.org
